{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07715","headline":"白云先生王迥见访 · 孟浩然","name":"白云先生王迥见访","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闲归日无事，云卧昼不起。\n有客款柴扉，自云巢居子。\n居闲好芝术，采药来城市。\n家在鹿门山，常游涧泽水。\n手持白羽扇，脚步青芒履。\n闻道鹤书徵，临流还洗耳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07715.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07715","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}